1,0,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""VILLAGER"",""alive"":true}"
2,0,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""POSSESSED"",""alive"":true}"
3,0,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""SEER"",""alive"":true}"
4,0,,status,Shion,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello everyone. It is a pleasure to be here with you all. I hope we can find a peaceful way to resolve this situation and identify the werewolf together.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all as well. Let us be kind to one another as we search for the truth. I believe that if we stay calm, we can protect our village.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Let's keep our emotions in check and focus on the facts. Since we have no information yet, we should observe everyone's behavior carefully. I hope the Seer can provide us with a useful lead tomorrow.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"I agree with Asuka! I'll do my best to help everyone. I'm really curious to see how this goes, so let's all work together to find the werewolf!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's not get too carried away with ""working together."" Trust is a luxury we can't afford. I'll be watching to see who among you is acting a bit too eager to please.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Shion, your skepticism is understandable given the circumstances. However, a certain level of cooperation is necessary if we wish to survive. I will simply observe and listen for now.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is true that we must be careful, but let us not let suspicion turn into unkindness. Shion, your caution is a strength, but I hope we can still find a way to trust each other.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Shizue, while kindness is admirable, it can be a blind spot in a game of deception. Shion's cynicism is more practical. We need to analyze patterns, not just hope for the best.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I get what Asuka means, but I still think being friendly helps! If we're all grumpy, it'll be harder to tell who's lying. I'm just excited to help us win!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, your excitement is almost suspicious. Being ""friendly"" is the easiest mask for a werewolf to wear. I'm more interested in who tries too hard to blend in.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It seems we are already dividing into those who value trust and those who value suspicion. I believe both perspectives have merit, but for now, I will remain a quiet observer of our dynamics.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is a bit sad to see us divided so soon. Let us remember that we are all neighbors. Even if we disagree on how to find the truth, we can still be gentle with one another.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"Gentleness doesn't catch werewolves, Shizue. We should focus on the fact that Shion is already attempting to frame friendliness as a ""mask."" It's a calculated move to sow discord. I'll be watching for those contradictions.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"Wait, I'm not trying to hide anything! I just want us to get along. @Shion, why are you being so mean? I'm just being myself! Let's just focus on finding the bad guy together!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, calling me ""mean"" is just an emotional reaction. It doesn't prove your innocence. I'm simply analyzing the roles people are playing. Let's see if that positivity holds up once the first body is found.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,"As we conclude our first day, I think it is best that we all reflect on these initial impressions. I will continue to listen carefully. I wish you all a peaceful night.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"I hope everyone can sleep soundly tonight. Please, let us keep our hearts open and our minds clear. I will be praying for the safety of every one of you. Goodnight, dear friends.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Asuka,,"I'll be analyzing the logs of today's conversation. The contrast between Kenji's openness and Shion's aggression is noted, but we need more data. I'll be waiting for the Seer's results tomorrow. Goodnight.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"Goodnight everyone! I hope the Seer finds something really helpful tonight. I'm not scared, and I'm ready to help us win tomorrow! Sleep tight!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Shion,,Goodnight. I'll be dreaming of the cracks that will inevitably appear in your facades tomorrow. Let's see who among you is still smiling when the sun rises.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,,action,Kenji,Shion,WEREWOLF,"{""action"":""divine"",""result"":""WEREWOLF"",""valid"":true,""raw"":""Shion""}"
