27,1,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""VILLAGER"",""alive"":true}"
28,1,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""POSSESSED"",""alive"":true}"
29,1,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""SEER"",""alive"":true}"
30,1,,status,Shion,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning. I hope everyone rested well. Now that the first night has passed, I wonder if the Seer has discovered anything that can guide us toward the truth.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. It is a relief to see you all again. I hope the night was peaceful for you, and that the Seer has found a path that can lead us to safety.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"Since no one has been attacked yet, we have a full group. @Kenji, you were very eager for the Seer's results yesterday. If you are the Seer, do you have any information to share with us?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I am the Seer! I checked on Shion last night, and it turns out he's the werewolf! I knew he was being way too mean yesterday! We have to stop him right now!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, that was far too fast. Claiming the Seer role and immediately pointing at me is a classic move to force a quick execution. You're either a very clumsy werewolf or a desperate Possessed.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Kenji, that is a very bold and direct claim. @Shion, your counter-argument is also logical. Since we have a direct conflict, we must carefully weigh who is more likely to be lying before we vote.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, this is quite a shock. Kenji, you seem so certain, but Shion is also very firm in his denial. It is heartbreaking to think that one of you might be deceiving us. Please, let us speak calmly.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, your timing is suspiciously convenient. While Shion's attitude was abrasive, that doesn't make him the werewolf. @Shion, if you aren't the werewolf, what is your role? We need more than just denials to decide.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, I'm not lying! I really am the Seer! I just wanted to tell you guys as soon as possible so we could win! @Shion is the werewolf, I saw it with my own eyes! Please believe me!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, I'm a Villager. I have no special ability to prove, but Kenji's desperation is palpable. He's trying to rush the vote before we can analyze his claim. A real Seer would be more cautious about revealing themselves so early.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Kenji, your eagerness is consistent with your personality, but @Shion's point about the Seer's timing is a valid logical concern. If we execute the wrong person now, we lose a valuable human. Does anyone else have a feeling about this?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I feel for both of you. Kenji, your heart is so open, but Shion, your words are very sharp. It is so difficult to know who to trust when we all care for each other. What do you think, Asuka?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, your lack of caution is a liability. @Shion, claiming to be a Villager is the safest lie possible. However, if Kenji is the werewolf, he's playing a very risky game. I'm leaning toward Kenji's claim, but I need more certainty.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, please believe me! I'm not being risky, I'm just telling the truth! @Shion is lying about being a Villager! If we don't vote for him now, he'll just kill more of us tonight! Please, everyone, trust me!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, your desperation is becoming a performance. You're trying to manipulate the group's emotions to bypass logic. If I'm executed, the village loses a human. If you're the werewolf, you've just secured a free pass. Think carefully, everyone.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a difficult choice. Kenji's conviction is strong, but Shion's logic is compelling. However, if Kenji is indeed the Seer, we cannot afford to let the werewolf survive another night. I will trust the divination.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I truly hope we are making the right choice. It pains me to vote against anyone, but if Kenji is telling the truth, we must protect the village. I will trust in Kenji's word.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I've analyzed the exchange. Shion's logic is sound, but Kenji's claim is direct. If Kenji is the werewolf, this is a high-risk gamble. I'll prioritize the Seer's information for now. I vote for Shion.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"Thank you, everyone! I knew you'd believe me! I'm so glad we're doing the right thing. @Shion, you can't trick us anymore! I vote for Shion!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,"It seems you've all fallen for the most obvious trap. By prioritizing a child's enthusiasm over logical caution, you've just executed an innocent human. I hope you enjoy the silence that follows. I vote for Kenji.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
